  "dialog.matteroverdrive.generic.quit.questions": "Увидимся.;Я должен идти.;Я спешу.;До Свидания.;Прощай.;Пока.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.generic.back.questions": "Неважно.;Давай поговорим о чём-нибудь другом.;Мне всё равно.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.generic.trade.questions": "Я хочу обменяться.;Давай обмениваться.;Позвольте мне увидеть ваши товары.;Что у вас есть для продажи?;",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.generic.back_home.questions": "Неважно.;Давай поговорим о чём-нибудь другом.;Мне всё равно.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.convert.question": "У меня есть все части!",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.requirements.line": "Наконец-то!<br>Избавление от этого хрупкого тела это лучший выбор.<br>Единственная проблема заключается в том, что нужно, чтобы ты принёс мне все части Андроида, прежде чем мы начнем.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.requirements.question": "Я хочу стать Андроидом.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.main.line.human": "Я не имею дела с людьми.;НЕТ! Я могу даже смотреть на тебя. Ты такой хрупкий!;Ты в порядке? Ты выглядишь захваченным! Как ты живёшь в этом теле?",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.main.line.android": "Ах %1$s, рад тебя видеть! Что привело тебя сюда?;Привет. Вы смотритесь великолепно!;Мне кажется ваш левый глаз косит. Я буду рад исправить это.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.undo.line": "Почему вы хотите сделать это? Единственный путь, проглотить синюю пилюлю. Она может быть найдена в подземельях, но вам лучше всего купить её у кого-то. Я думаю, что у меня они были в мастерской. Я должен это проверить.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.undo.question": "Как отменить это?",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.whatDidYouDo.line": "Теперь ты Андроид! Тебе больше не нужно есть, спать и кислород вдыхать. Ты можешь улучшать себя чудесными способностями в «Андроид станции», и после этого увидеть и сделать вещи, которые до этого не делал.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.whatDidYouDo.question": "Что ты сделал со мной?",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.main.line": "Привет дружище [§6отрыжка§r].;В чем дело, дружище.;",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.question": "Ты что-то сказал о коктейле?",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.question.accept": "§aДа, черт возьми!",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.question.decline": "§cFuck NO!",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.0.line": "Ты-ты-ты должен помочь мне, дружище.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.1.line": "I have-have this [§6отрыжка§r] amazing recipe, buddy, just amazing things with stuff mixed together, buddy.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.2.line": "It - it's gonna be better than... no it's incomparable, buddy, it's the pinnacle of perfection, buddy [§6отрыжка§r].",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.3.line": "But you see I need these things, buddy! I-I need some of that creeper POWDER, buddy and-and [§6отрыжка§r] some mushrooms from the NETHER!",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.4.question": "[почесать задницу]",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.4.line": "But see here now, buddy! Hey, stop scratching your ass, buddy, it's v-v-very important!",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.5.question": "извини.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.5.line": "That powder stuff from the creeper keeps its potency only if you kill it with a shovel, buddy.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.6.question": "Лопата?",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.6.line": "Yes, a fucking shovel, buddy, you-you have to smash its brains out, repeated blunt traumas, buddy, to get the good stuff!",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.7.line": "Now, go, buddy, quickly, buddy, go!",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.complete.question": "I have all the ingredients for your cocktail.",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.line": "Ah yes, now let me get these thing out of you buddy, take the burden of your shoulders, let me just mix up a batch and.... [§6junkie scientist mixes up the ingredients and takes a snort....§r]",
  "dialog.matteroverdrive.mad_scientist.junkie.cocktail_quest.are_you_ok.question": "Ты в порядке?",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.kill_androids.0.title": "Они убьют нас всех!",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.kill_androids.0.info": "The are taking over the world! I know it! We must fight our machine overlords. If we don't, we will all perish. The fight starts with you %1$s! I need you to kill %2$s %3$s before they get to us.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.kill_androids.0.objective.0": "Убить %2$s/%3$s Андроидов-разбойников.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.cocktail_of_ascension.title": "Коктейль Вознесения",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.cocktail_of_ascension.info": "A Crazy scientist has asked you to bring him %2$s gunpowder from a shoveled creeper and %3$s red mushrooms from the darkest depths of the Nether, for his Cocktail Of Ascension.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.cocktail_of_ascension.objective.0": "Убить %2$s/%3$s криперов лопатой",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.cocktail_of_ascension.objective.1": "Собрать %2$s/%3$s пороха",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.cocktail_of_ascension.objective.2": "Собрать %2$s/%3$s красных грибов из Ада",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.cocktail_of_ascension.objective.3": "Поговорите с безумным учёным-наркоманом",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.sacrifice.title": "Жертва",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.sacrifice.info": "We are the Dark Vail. We have begun restoring an ancient artifact, the effects of which will remain a secret. All we need from you %1$s is to sacrifice %2$s %3$s newborns in the name of the dark lord, whose name strikes fear in the hearts of the innocent. Barry the dark lord. You will be compensated handsomely for your efforts.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.sacrifice.objective.0": "Убить %2$s/%3$s Baby %4$s",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.department_of_agriculture.title": "Департамент сельского хозяйства",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.department_of_agriculture.info": "To all willing hands. This is a job offer from the department of agriculture. We operate in the desolate world of Barus V and you can image the obstacles we face when it comes to growing %3$s. As our plans for hydroponic farms come to turn, our people starve to death. We are searching for capable parties to aid us in the supplying of %3$s to our citizens.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.department_of_agriculture.objective.0": "Собрать %2$s/%3$s %4$s",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.one_true_love.title": "One true love",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.one_true_love.info": "I'm so happy! You can't even imagine what a joyous moment this is! Merry has finally agreed to merry me. You don't even know how many times I've tried to win her heart. At long last her father gave us his blessing. I know our love is more than enough to keeps us going, but I wanted to give her something special. I was hoping you can find me a diamond so I can put a marvelous ring onto her precious finger. I will forever be in dept and I will be more than happy to compensate for you troubles.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.one_true_love.objective.0": "Mine $mineAmount/$maxMineAmount Diamonds",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.weapons_of_war.title": "Weapons of war",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.weapons_of_war.info": "They have oppressed us for long enough! Our proud people will no longer stand for this. Years of oppression, end now! We may be broken in body be we are strong in spirit. This is where we need your help. It may not be pretty, but war is coming and we need a way to defend ourselves. They will throw everything they have at us. The first step to winning the fight is building anvils and then using those anvils to craft the weapons we desperately need.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.weapons_of_war.objective.0": "Craft $craftAmount/$craftMaxAmount $craftItem",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.weapons_of_war.objective.1": "Сделать %2$s мечей.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.to_the_power_of.title": "To the power of",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.to_the_power_of.info": "Before I can begin work on my ascension from my limiting mortality I need to ensure a consistent source of power.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.to_the_power_of.objective.0": "Create $craftAmount/$craftMaxAmount $craftItem",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.puny_humans.title": "Puny Humans",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.puny_humans.info": "I have spoken to scientist, who is obviously mad, but makes quite the offering. He has agreed to make me into an android. All I need to do is collect a full set of Android Parts for the procedure. Rouge Androids seem to be the only ones who drop the parts needed.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.puny_humans.objective.0": "Collect a full set of android parts",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.puny_humans.objective.1": "Talk to the mad scientist",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.is_it_really_me.title": "Is it really me ?",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.is_it_really_me.info": "Our investors have finally decided to let us begin human trails. We are all ready to proceed whenever you are. We have done rigorous testing on animals and inanimate objects and the fail rate is well below 25%. We can assure you that everything will go according to plan. Of course there is still the matter of the psychological barriers, we don't know how exactly the Edux got over them, but we are positive you can push yourself to do it. Just step onto the platform and close your eyes.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.is_it_really_me.objective.0": "Use a Transporter",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.beast_belly.title": "The belly of the beast",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.beast_belly.info": "There is no easy way to say this, but we need you to die for us. For science! Have you ever encountered strange gravitational anomalies? We can't figure out exactly what happens then matter is introduced into their event horizon. We can see it growing, but where does all that matter go ? We want you to travel into the event horizon of a gravitational anomaly and see what mysteries lie within. Be careful, it might hurt a bit.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.beast_belly.objective.0": "Travel into an anomaly's horizon",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.crash_landing.title": "Crash Landing",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.crash_landing.info": "Captain's Log stardate 48940.8./n//n/I've had to initiate emergency landing procedures. My ship's port nacelle is completely fried. I have enough emergency rations to last me for a while, but the watter tank was ruptured./n/I must get out and find fresh water pronto./n/From what I can gather by looking at the star charts , I seem to have crashed somewhere in the orion sector. Last I heard the whole sector was overwhelmed with Edux rejects./n/I guess that means I won't find anybody to talk to in a while./n/To think this happened just before I got to finally visit Emily for the first time, in 5 years.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.crash_landing.objective.0": "Build a $craftItem and try to hack the terminal to contact the captain's family.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.we_must_know.title": "We must know",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.we_must_know.info": "Thank you for contacting us./n/I still find this whole ordeal shocking. I know we weren't on the best of terms for quite some time, but I just can't imagine what my daughter feels right now./n/Emily is quite a strong woman, but she didn't take the news very well./n/I have one last request of you. As his commanding officer It's my duty to honor the death of a fellow solder. Hell it's the least I can do./n/Will you put down the $block I've sent you so that we can retrieve all of his logs. I know he cared deeply for my Emily and I hope there is something in there to put my daughter's mind at ease.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.we_must_know.objective.0": "Place the $block near the ship at $distance away.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.gmo.title": "G.M.O.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.gmo.info": "Replicating vegetables! That's just absurd!/n/They taste awful, all those replicated stuff feel just like eating plastic./n/No no, we need something different. I just got my new biolistic particle delivery system and I can't wait to test that baby out. I see all these pathetic villagers planting their crops, crawling in the dirt like animals. I just need to get my hands on some crop gene sequences. The thing is these brainless, villagers won't let me anywhere near the crops. Can you use my Data Pad and scan some for me? I'm sure I can give you something for the favor. I had some old android parts laying around.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.gmo.objective.0": "Scan $scanAmount/$maxScanAmount $block with the Scientist's Data Pad.",
  "quest.matteroverdrive.gmo.objective.1": "Now scan $scanAmount/$maxScanAmount $block.",
